notes.content:
[list]
[*] Fixed the issue when workers were stuck and didn't return to their workplaces;
[*] Added crash reporter client to send more details about crashes if they happened to the developers (don't worry, it doesn't send any private information, only the log file and the crash dump);
[*] Fixed a potential exploit in the Daily Challenge;
[*] Fixed several other minor bugs and crashes;
[/list]

What we improved:
[list]
[*] Quality of life improvements, including some community requests;
[*] Fixed dozens of minor or rare bugs in HUD and localization - they are mostly invisible to people but arrive from time to time;
[*] Fixed leaderboard which showed only 100 records;
[*] Excluded the Reorganization event from the week bonuses if no workplaces are affected.
[/list]

Minor update with several critical fixes:

[list]
[*] Fixed a freeze when entering a big number in the map seed field;
[*] Fixed wrong behavior on the Leaderboards page;
[*] Lowered the rate of false positives in virus checks;
[*] Removed inconsistency with map seeds after loading a saved game (works only for new games).
[/list]
